339
00:09:03,180 --> 00:09:03,830
Three.

340
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,770
There's only so much room
in there.

341
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:07,230
Bending compresses it.

342
00:09:07,410 --> 00:09:09,040
Straightening pulls it
tight.

343
00:09:09,180 --> 00:09:10,540
That's the squeeze.

344
00:09:10,590 --> 00:09:11,240
Four.

345
00:09:11,530 --> 00:09:13,490
Red and near-infrared
light have been

346
00:09:13,490 --> 00:09:15,790
