inflammation,

347
00:09:15,790 --> 00:09:17,160
so the swelling and the
pressure

348
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,370
can come down with it.

349
00:09:18,690 --> 00:09:20,480
In a randomized trial,

350
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:22,260
patients given light
therapy after

351
00:09:22,260 --> 00:09:24,620
